    "description": "Production-grade Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) API for Paulo Coelho's *The Alchemist*. Integrates local 384-dimensional SentenceTransformer embeddings, Supabase PostgreSQL pgvector cosine similarity search, and Google Gemini 3.8 Flash for strictly grounded literary question answering.",
